  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 415.04 Rental Agent Registration Application/Permit Forms.\n\n(a) “Rental Agent Registration Application/Permit” forms, DSSS 114 effective November 2016, may be obtained by writing or calling the department of safety, division of state police, marine patrol unit, 31 Dock Road, Gilford, NH 03249-7627, (603) 293-2037.\n\n(b) An applicant shall submit the completed “Rental Agent Registration Application/Permit” form, DSSS 114, effective November 2016, and the registration fee to the division of safety services.\n\n(c) An incomplete registration application shall be returned to the applicant with a letter of explanation.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading) #9211, eff 7-21-08; (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading) renumbered by #9544 (formerly Saf-C 414.04); ss by #12066, eff 12-19-16",
